    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SMARTLEAD WEBHOOK HANDLER\nReceives webhook events from Smartlead and syncs lead status back to Google Sheets.\n\n**Events handled:**\n- `EMAIL_REPLY` → status = \"replied\"\n- `LEAD_CATEGORY_UPDATED` → maps category (Interested, Not Interested, etc.)\n- `LEAD_UNSUBSCRIBED` → status = \"unsubscribed\"\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Activate this workflow in n8n\n2. Copy the webhook URL (shown in the Webhook Trigger node)\n3. In Smartlead → Campaign Settings → Webhooks → paste the URL\n4. Enable events: EMAIL_REPLY, LEAD_CATEGORY_UPDATED, LEAD_UNSUBSCRIBED\n\n**Google Sheet:** Must match the same sheet used by the main lead gen workflow.",
        "height": 320, "width": 440, "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-instructions",
      "name": "Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-400, 50]
    }
  ],
